WASHINGTON – The Senate Judiciary Committee today advanced the following nominations:

Jennifer Lee Mascott, to be United States Circuit Judge for the Third Circuit, by a vote of 12-10;

Edmund G. LaCour, Jr., to be United States District Judge for the Northern District of Alabama, by a vote of 12-10;

Bill Lewis, to be United States District Judge for the Middle District of Alabama, by a vote of 14-8;

